# AI Model Usage by Feature

The dAIolog discipline: **every AI feature registers here** — which model tier it uses and where the call lives. Model IDs come from the `MODELS` config (`apps/web/lib/ai.ts` / `apps/api/src/ai.ts`), never inline strings; swaps are one-line and this table is how you find every affected feature during a model migration.

## Tiers

| Tier | Model (MODELS key) | Use for |
|---|---|---|
| default | `anthropic/claude-sonnet-5` | quality generation, analysis |
| fast | `anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5` | classification, summaries, high-volume/latency-sensitive paths |

Verify IDs against the live list before a migration: `curl -s https://ai-gateway.vercel.sh/v1/models` — and re-check `https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/models/migration-guide.md`.

