Rules: structured output via `Output.object` + Zod on every payload (BP §6); tool loops need a stop condition (`stopWhen`); pin Gateway routing (`only` + `order`) so a fallback can't silently bill a provider you didn't choose; graceful degradation when no AI key is present — never crash the host page.
